    "checker": "exact single required scheme token; generated_checker is null",
    "uniqueOutputProof": "Two distinct pair schemes require every pair of positions in each stanza to share the same kth-vowel suffix, hence all three schemes. The statement explicitly requires aaaa when every stanza is pairwise rhyming (also sample 2). Otherwise at most one pair scheme survives; no surviving scheme means NO.",
    "tooFewVowels": "A line with fewer than k vowels cannot rhyme, even with an identical line.",
    "oracle": "Reverse-scan to kth vowel, retain exact complete suffix; intersect pair schemes over stanzas. O(total length) time and space.",
    "independentReference": "For each prescribed pair, count vowels in its longest common suffix; the pair rhymes iff this count >=k. Evaluate all pairing schemes independently, with no suffix-extraction helper."
  },
